&lt;p&gt;Beyond Open Source, I&#39;m a joyful product-and-team-first startup veteran and founder across many industry sectors, as well as an experienced and popular people leader, programming language nerd, consultant and freelancer.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;In recent years I&#39;ve alternated between hands-on technical direction of challenging projects (Head of Engineering, Principal Engineer), and growing/nurturing technical orgs of 60-90 engineers (VP Eng, Senior Director).&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;I&#39;m &lt;strong&gt;occasionally available for hire&lt;/strong&gt;, so feel free to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:steve@sanityinc.com&quot;&gt;get in touch&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
